"Event Horizon is the Guardian's gear-studded staff, an Epic artifact that changes shape."
"It can become the Guardian's flaming axe and has its own weapon core."
"It has a personality, dislikes being a bladed weapon and grows bloodthirsty."
"It gains self-awareness after absorbing enough essence when its bearer ascends."
"It speaks to its bearer through a bond and boosts her gravity magic."
"A sliver of its core goes into the frame of Devin's axe."
